<speak>I'm ready to listen. I've put a divider between the review notes and the housekeeping page, which will make it easier to find the right section later. Thank you for giving the conversation some space. It hasn't felt like I needed to hurry through a list while trying to remember where everything was. That suits me much better than taking a call from the car park or answering between two office meetings, which is what I used to do.</speak>